    <string name="privacy_policy_title">Kin+ Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_body">What we collect: your name, email, phone number, your location while sharing is switched on, and any Safety, Safe Zone or Journey details you choose to set up.\n\nWhy: to power the features you use — sharing your location with your Circles, sending an SOS with your location attached, Safe Zone entry/exit alerts and Safe Journey watchers.\n\nWho sees it: only the members of the Circles you join can see your shared location. We never sell your personal information to third parties.\n\nYour Emergency Information (medical details, vehicle, addresses, home security codes) and any profile or circle photo you add are stored only on this device — never sent to our servers.\n\nYour rights under POPIA: you can access, correct or delete your personal information at any time. You can pause location sharing instantly from Location Settings, and permanently delete your account and its data from Profile.\n\nSecurity: all data sent to our servers is encrypted in transit. Passwords are hashed and salted by Firebase Authentication — Kin+ never stores or sees your password.</string>
